      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Are you using this for the intended purpose (going off your other post about using this to orient upside down in the world)? If you lay down flat in your playspace and use horizon adjust (as an accessibility feature) to help you orient in VRC world space to the normal standing direction and calibrate I believe it should function properly. If that's not the case please detail how it fails.\nOr in general, more specifics on what preciously you're doing and how it fails would be helpful.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
